  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I'd like there to be an option to disable the textbox for a specific user. \n\nA lot of user use the textbox for useless things like their fan speed, which is important to pretty much no one. \n\nCurrently, the only way to do so is to mute the person completely or disabling the textbox all together. While option 1 works and is what I've been doing, I sometimes still want to be able to speak to the person. Option 2 severely limits the ability of mute people to communicate with me altogether.  \n\nI've attached an example image of why textboxes can be annoying.",
